<title>USA: AEP buys Australian printer.</title>
<headline>AEP buys Australian printer.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH HACKENSACK, N.J. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>AEP Industries Inc said it acquired Duplas Pty Ltd, a privately-held printer, laminator and converter of flexible packaging products based in Sydney, Australia for about $1 million.</p>
<p>Duplas has annual sales of abou t$10 million.</p>
</text>
